WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.022
Now we combine lists with the control flow from Module 2.

00:00:04.022 --> 00:00:06.957
The loop takes one wait time at a time.

00:00:06.957 --> 00:00:11.962
If the value is greater than ten minutes, the program labels it for review.

00:00:11.962 --> 00:00:14.692
Otherwise it labels the wait as acceptable.

00:00:15.398 --> 00:00:20.566
For the current values, eleven and eighteen should be flagged for review.

00:00:20.566 --> 00:00:24.606
Four, seven, and six should be acceptable.

00:00:24.606 --> 00:00:30.290
This is the bridge from storing a collection to actually analyzing each observation in it.
